{"actor":{"display":"Evin Tunador","id":"evintunador@gmail.com","type":"human"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"240\t * producer.version/tool — is deliberately excluded: a re-ingestion under a\n241\t * different HEAD or adapter version must dedup, not duplicate.\n242\t *\n243\t * `producer.model`/`provider`/`source_version` are excluded for the same\n244\t * reason even though they *are* source-determined and stable per line. They\n245\t * were added after events had already been captured without them, so folding\n246\t * them into identity would give the very same transcript line a different id\n247\t * before and after the upgrade — a rescan would duplicate every pre-upgrade\n248\t * turn rather than dedup it. Identity answers \"which piece of source material\n249\t * is this\"; the model that served it is provenance about that material, not\n250\t * a second copy of it.\n251\t */\n252\texport function eventId(event: EventDraft): string {\n253\t  const identity = {\n254\t    schema: SCHEMA_VERSION,\n255\t    kind: event.kind,\n256\t    occurred_at: event.occurred_at,\n257\t    actor: { type: event.actor.type, id: event.actor.id },\n258\t    source: event.producer.source,\n259\t    session_id: event.producer.session_id,\n260\t    conversation: event.conversation,\n261\t    media_type: event.media_type,\n262\t    content: event.content,\n263\t    links: event.links,\n264\t  };\n265\t  return \"ev1-\" + sha256Hex(canonicalJson(identity));\n266\t}\n267\t\n268\texport function finalizeEvent(draft: EventDraft, now = new Date()): EvidenceEvent {\n269\t  const event: EvidenceEvent = {\n270\t    ...draft,\n271\t    id: draft.id ?? eventId(draft),\n272\t    schema: SCHEMA_VERSION,\n273\t    recorded_at: draft.recorded_at ?? now.toISOString(),\n274\t  };\n275\t  const problems = validateEvent(event);\n276\t  if (problems.length > 0) {\n277\t    throw new Error(`invalid event: ${problems.join(\"; \")}`);\n278\t  }\n279\t  return event;","tool_use_id":"toolu_01YCf5yaCDA7CD35d